<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GFSA's O'Okiep posts Dec qtr net profit.</title>
<headline>GFSA's O'Okiep posts Dec qtr net profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-December versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending    5.98 vs 10.17 loss</p>
<p>    Capital spending			    2.08 vs 1.01</p>
<p>    Sales					  74.99 vs 50.89</p>
<p>    Cost of sales				69.84 vs 59.49</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			   434,000  vs 432,000</p>
<p>    Copper grade (percent)		    1.28 vs 1.66</p>
<p>    Copper produced (tonnes)		8,595  vs 7,494</p>
<p>    Copper sold (tonnes)		    7,652  vs 6,524</p>
<p>Full name: O'okiep Copper Company Ltd, owned by Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
